  "status": "experimental",
  "trust": "local",
  "description": "Radikal Technologies Delta CEP A and A2 swarm-oscillator synthesizers: every sound parameter of the manual's MIDI controller table, with its range and neutral value.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "DELTA CEP A2 manual (US/UK, version 2)",
      "notes": "The MIDI controller table (PDF pages 54 - 55), read by tools/profiles/radikal/read-radikal-manual.mjs from DELTA_CEP_A2_US_UK-1.pdf (sha256 80b416579509fe1ab918c8217d9d831407b78187c5ed106a6c0bb1665b9eb596), https://www.radikaltechnologies.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/DELTA_CEP_A2_US_UK-1.pdf, linked from https://www.radikaltechnologies.com/delta-cep-a-a2-version-2-new-manuals/. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/radikal/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/radikal/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI controller table, sent as its controller on the channel variable, its range the `Bereich` printed and its default the `Neutral` value where one is printed. The Delta must be in Manual mode for the controllers to take effect, the manual says. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "Values named in the parameter's text (`(0=Multimode, 1=LP24, 2=Analog)`, `OFF/ON1/ON2`) are choices; the swarm's tune is one 14-bit value over CC 47 and 48, the MSB sent first.",
    "The delay time is laid out as its two halves, Delay Time coarse (CC 89) and Delay Time LSB (CC 90): the manual has the 3-bit LSB sent before the coarse value, so set the LSB first.",
    "The filter band (CC 63) is a bit field, as printed: bit 0 LP, bit 1 BP, bit 2 HP. Program changes (0 - 39 the user memories, 64 - 103 the ROM) are not laid out.",
    "The PDF's text layer loses the `ff` ligature; `VCF Cuto` is read as VCF Cutoff (the layout names it)."
  ],
  "variables": {
    "channel": 1
  },
  "coverage": {
    "singleParameterWrite": "complete-for-the-controller-table: 65 parameters",
